more unsettling meaning. The date it was created.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:17.280 position:63%
Stuck painted dissonance in 1910. And precisely&nbsp;
in those years, European music was going through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:24.000 position:63%
a true revolution. Composers like Schönberg were&nbsp;
abandoning traditional harmony. And their works&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:29.440 position:63%
full of sounds that the public found dissonant&nbsp;
caused scandals in concert halls. But it was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:35.600 position:63%
not only music that was changing. painting was&nbsp;
too. And here there is something curious. Some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:40.720 position:63%
of the artists who were beginning to break with&nbsp;
tradition had been students of Stuck himself at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:46.400 position:63%
